  "title": "Spring Rolls",
  "description": "These tasty spring rolls are packed with vegetables, seafood and pork. They contain a lot of ingredients but are worth the effort. Serve them with your favorite sauce. Some types of mushrooms may need to be soaked 2 to 3 hours before use.",
  "authors": [
    "SALLYCOOKS"
  ],
